OL,3,GNEWSAStates panel upholds seawall
OL,4,Acomplaint
OL,5,
OL,6,FA States' panel has upheld a complaint
OL,7,Fagainst the government after its
OL,8,Fproperty management company said it was
OL,9,Fnot responsible for maintaining a
OL,10,Fsection of seawall.
OL,12,FJersey Property Holdings, the States'
OL,13,Fappointed corporate landlord for public
OL,14,Fland and buildings, previously said the
OL,15,Fparapet section of the wall adjacent to
OL,16,Fflats at Brise de Mer, La Greve
OL,17,Fd'Azette, St Clement, did not fall
OL,18,Fwithin its remit.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,445,440,260,160,0,100
