OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.* %%** %%**,$-, *(,% ,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAStates panel upholds seawall
OL,4,Acomplaint
OL,5,
OL,6,FA complaint was later filed against the
OL,7,Fminister for infrastructure on behalf
OL,8,Fof the Brise de Mer Apartments
OL,9,FAssociation.
OL,11,FThis was upheld in July, concluding the
OL,12,Fentire wall was owned by the public of
OL,13,Fthe Island and the landowner - the
OL,14,Fpublic - bore responsibility for its
OL,15,Fsafety.
